      "order": 2,
      "text": "For regulation 10.1, the following shall be substituted: '10.1 Transferable Development Rights (TDR) and Premium FAR Loading: Plots abutting roads of 9.0 m to 12.0 m may load up to 0.20 Premium FAR; roads above 12.0 m to 18.0 m up to 0.40; and roads above 18.0 m up to 0.60 over the permissible base FAR under Chapter 11 and Table 11.1.'",
